  "description": "A 0.2 document under semantics 0.2: taking the exhausted route deletes the streak, so after a person sends keep-going the next red counts 1 and the limit is used up again only after two more.",
  "workflow": {
    "actions": {
      "test": {
        "argv": ["test"],
        "effect": "read-only",
        "kind": "command",
        "outcomes": ["ok", "red"]
